            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lorie C Harding"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were sooo good! I added some vanilla and a pinch of salt (as per another review) and used chopped walnuts. They baked up wonderfully - they didn't spill over at all. Next time, though, I'll pre-bake my tart shells. Thanks for the recipe :)",
            "datePublished": "2018-08-23T20:55:35.930Z"
